    {
      "id": "text:amenirdis",
      "title": "amenirdis",
      "kind": "interpretation",
      "description": "The name literally means 'she was given by Amun'. As 'singer of the interior of Amun', Amenirdis made music in the temple of Amun in Thebes. The writing of 'Amun' is shared between the title and the name.",
